---
description: Design system rules for balashov-cv-client
globs: src/**/*.scss, src/**/*.html
---

- Use tokens from src/styles/_design-tokens.scss only (--cv-* variables)
- Spacing scale: 4, 8, 12, 16, 24, 32, 48, 64
- Section max-width: 960px centered
- Prefer mat-card / custom .cv-card over raw paragraphs
- Animations: CSS only, prefers-reduced-motion respected
- Reuse existing widgets (header, technology-item, tag-filter)
- Do not add Tailwind CSS
- Do not break API integrations or TechnologiesService / drawer / contact-me logic
